---
import GuideLayout from '../../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';
---

<GuideLayout slug="viewmaxxing-on-pc">
  <div class="vm-guide">
    <div class="vm-hero">
      <p class="vm-hero__kicker">No box? No problem.</p>
      <p class="vm-hero__line">
        Run <strong>viewmaxxing</strong> on your PC with a free Android emulator. Same app the TV box
        runs — driven by your keyboard, mouse, or a controller.
      </p>
      <div class="vm-glance">
        <span class="vm-chip"><span class="vm-chip__i">⏱</span> ~10 min</span>
        <span class="vm-chip"><span class="vm-chip__i">💵</span> $0</span>
        <span class="vm-chip"><span class="vm-chip__i">🎮</span> Easy</span>
        <span class="vm-chip"><span class="vm-chip__i">🖥</span> Windows PC</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="vm-intro">
      Viewmaxxing folds <strong>YouTube, Twitch, movies, TV and anime</strong> into one ad-free app.
      It's built for TV boxes — but "built for" isn't "locked to." It's a normal Android app, and an
      emulator is just Android in a window on your PC. Here's the fast way to get it running <em>well</em>.
    </p>

    <h2>⚡ Why it just works</h2>
    <ul class="vm-checks">
      <li><strong>It's a standard APK.</strong> Runs on any Android 8+. Every emulator ships newer than that.</li>
      <li><strong>The icon actually shows up.</strong> It's built for a normal app drawer too — the usual reason TV apps hide on PC doesn't apply.</li>
      <li><strong>Full speed, no lag tax.</strong> The app ships Intel/AMD code, so it runs native instead of crawling through translation.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>🛠 Get it running — 4 steps</h2>

    <div class="vm-steps">
      <div class="vm-step">
        <div class="vm-step__num">1</div>
        <div class="vm-step__body">
          <h3>Install an emulator</h3>
          <p>Grab <strong>BlueStacks 5</strong> from its official site (easiest). On a low-spec PC,
            <strong>LDPlayer 9</strong> is lighter. No Google login needed.</p>
          <p class="vm-note">👉 If setup offers <strong>virtualization (VT-x / AMD-V)</strong>, turn it on. It's the #1 thing that makes it smooth vs. sluggish.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="vm-step">
        <div class="vm-step__num">2</div>
        <div class="vm-step__body">
          <h3>Grab the APK</h3>
          <p>Join the Maxxtopia Discord → open <span class="vm-tag">#free-stuff</span> → download the latest
            <code>.apk</code> to your Desktop.</p>
          <p class="vm-note">🔗 <strong>discord.gg/S78eecbWdx</strong> — the app self-updates after this, so you only do it once.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="vm-step">
        <div class="vm-step__num">3</div>
        <div class="vm-step__body">
          <h3>Drag it in</h3>
          <p>With the emulator open, <strong>drag the <code>.apk</code> onto the window</strong> and drop.
            The icon appears in a few seconds.</p>
          <p class="vm-note">🧩 Drag not working? Use the <strong>Install APK</strong> button in the side toolbar (BlueStacks: under "System apps").</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="vm-step">
        <div class="vm-step__num">4</div>
        <div class="vm-step__body">
          <h3>Open it &amp; play</h3>
          <p>Launch viewmaxxing. Home paints with the tab bar up top. Go <strong>full screen</strong>
            (BlueStacks: <span class="vm-key">F11</span>) for the couch feel — it's landscape already.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>🎮 The controls</h2>
    <p>Remote-first, which on PC is a <em>good</em> thing — the defaults already work, no custom setup:</p>
    <div class="vm-controls">
      <div class="vm-ctrl">
        <div class="vm-ctrl__keys">
          <span class="vm-key">↑</span><span class="vm-key">↓</span><span class="vm-key">←</span><span class="vm-key">→</span>
        </div>
        <span class="vm-ctrl__label">Move around</span>
      </div>
      <div class="vm-ctrl">
        <div class="vm-ctrl__keys"><span class="vm-key vm-key--wide">Enter</span></div>
        <span class="vm-ctrl__label">Select / play</span>
      </div>
      <div class="vm-ctrl">
        <div class="vm-ctrl__keys"><span class="vm-key vm-key--wide">Esc</span></div>
        <span class="vm-ctrl__label">Go back</span>
      </div>
      <div class="vm-ctrl">
        <div class="vm-ctrl__keys"><span class="vm-key">🖱</span></div>
        <span class="vm-ctrl__label">Click anything</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="vm-callout vm-callout--cyan">
      <p class="vm-callout__tag">⌨️ No arrow keys? (60% boards, laptops)</p>
      <p>Totally fine — arrows are just the convenient default. Any one of these drives the whole app:</p>
      <ul class="vm-mini">
        <li><strong>Mouse only</strong> — everything's clickable. Zero keys. Simplest answer.</li>
        <li><strong>Remap keys</strong> — bind <span class="vm-key">W</span><span class="vm-key">A</span><span class="vm-key">S</span><span class="vm-key">D</span> to the D-pad in the emulator's key editor. 30 seconds.</li>
        <li><strong>Plug in a controller</strong> — Xbox/PS pad works as a D-pad out of the box.</li>
        <li><strong>Fn layer</strong> — most 60% boards put arrows on <span class="vm-key">Fn</span>+WASD or IJKL.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>🚀 Make it run its best</h2>
    <div class="vm-tips">
      <div class="vm-tip"><span class="vm-tip__i">⚙️</span><div><strong>Enable virtualization.</strong> Biggest single win. Stutter = this is off. Turn on VT-x / AMD-V in BIOS.</div></div>
      <div class="vm-tip"><span class="vm-tip__i">🧠</span><div><strong>Give it room.</strong> 2–4 CPU cores and 2–4 GB RAM in the emulator's settings is plenty.</div></div>
      <div class="vm-tip"><span class="vm-tip__i">🔄</span><div><strong>Leave the updater on.</strong> The app keeps itself current, so you sideload once and forget it.</div></div>
      <div class="vm-tip"><span class="vm-tip__i">🚫</span><div><strong>Keep "Block ads in player" ON</strong> for ad-free YouTube/Twitch. Only flip it off if a movie loads to a white screen.</div></div>
    </div>

    <h2>🩹 Stuck? Quick fixes</h2>
    <div class="vm-fixes">
      <div class="vm-fix">
        <span class="vm-fix__p">Nothing plays</span>
        <span class="vm-fix__f">Try another title or "Choose server" — usually one dead mirror, not you. If <em>everything</em> fails, set your DNS to <strong>1.1.1.1</strong>.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="vm-fix">
        <span class="vm-fix__p">No icon after install</span>
        <span class="vm-fix__f">Wait a few seconds, check the app drawer. Still missing? Use the <strong>Install APK</strong> button instead of drag-drop.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="vm-fix">
        <span class="vm-fix__p">Feels slow</span>
        <span class="vm-fix__f">Virtualization is off, or it's starved. Enable VT-x / AMD-V and give it a couple cores.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="vm-outro">
      <strong>Real talk:</strong> viewmaxxing is a free, sideloaded, personal-grade app — no account, history
      stays on your device. An emulator adds a little overhead vs. a real box, but any modern PC eats that
      without blinking. Own a box? That's still the comfiest couch setup. Don't? This gets you the whole
      thing on the screen you already own. 🎉
    </p>
  </div>
</GuideLayout>

<style is:global>
  /* Scoped-by-prefix: .vm-guide only exists on this page, so these never leak. */
  .vm-guide { --g: #10b981; --c: #00d4ff; --amber: #fbbf24; }

  /* Hero */
  .vm-guide .vm-hero {
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--g) 45%, transparent);
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 140% at 0% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--g) 16%, transparent), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(120% 140% at 100% 100%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 12%, transparent), transparent 60%),
      #ffffff05;
    border-radius: 1.1rem; padding: 1.5rem 1.4rem; margin: 0 0 1.8rem;
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-hero__kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--g); margin: 0 0 0.6rem; font-weight: 700;
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-hero__line { font-size: 1.28rem; line-height: 1.4; color: #f3f1f8; margin: 0 0 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .vm-guide .vm-hero__line strong { color: var(--g); }

  .vm-guide .vm-glance { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .vm-guide .vm-chip {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; color: #ece9f4;
    background: #ffffff0d; border: 1px solid #ffffff1f; border-radius: 999px; padding: 0.34rem 0.75rem;
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-chip__i { font-size: 0.95rem; }

  .vm-guide .vm-intro { font-size: 1.06rem; line-height: 1.65; color: #cbc8d6; margin: 0 0 1rem; }

  /* Section headers get a touch more punch than the base prose h2 */
  .vm-guide h2 { font-size: 1.55rem; margin: 2.4rem 0 1rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .vm-guide h3 { margin: 0 0 0.4rem; color: #fff; font-size: 1.12rem; }

  /* Green-check list */
  .vm-guide .vm-checks { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 0.7rem; }
  .vm-guide .vm-checks li {
    position: relative; padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem 0.75rem 2.4rem; margin: 0;
    background: #ffffff06; border: 1px solid #ffffff12; border-radius: 0.7rem;
    color: #cbc8d6; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 0.99rem;
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-checks li::before {
    content: "✓"; position: absolute; left: 0.85rem; top: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--g); font-weight: 900; font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-checks strong { color: #f3f1f8; }

  /* Step cards */
  .vm-guide .vm-steps { display: grid; gap: 0.9rem; }
  .vm-guide .vm-step {
    display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff08, #ffffff03);
    border: 1px solid #ffffff14; border-left: 3px solid var(--g);
    border-radius: 0.9rem; padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-step__num {
    flex: 0 0 auto; width: 2.4rem; height: 2.4rem; border-radius: 0.7rem;
    display: grid; place-items: center; font-family: var(--font-display), sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #05140f;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--g), var(--c));
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px color-mix(in srgb, var(--g) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-step__body { min-width: 0; }
  .vm-guide .vm-step__body p { margin: 0 0 0.45rem; color: #c5c2d2; line-height: 1.55; font-size: 0.99rem; }
  .vm-guide .vm-step__body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .vm-guide .vm-note {
    font-size: 0.9rem !important; color: #a9d9c8 !important;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--g) 9%, transparent); border-radius: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem; margin-top: 0.5rem !important;
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.86em; color: var(--c);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 14%, transparent); border-radius: 0.35rem; padding: 0.05rem 0.4rem;
  }

  /* Keycaps */
  .vm-guide .vm-key {
    display: inline-grid; place-items: center; min-width: 1.7rem; height: 1.7rem; padding: 0 0.4rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: #f3f1f8;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a2740, #1a1830);
    border: 1px solid #4a4668; border-bottom-width: 3px; border-radius: 0.4rem; margin: 0 0.12rem;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-key--wide { min-width: 3.2rem; }

  .vm-guide .vm-controls {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(9rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.7rem; margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-ctrl {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem; text-align: center;
    background: #ffffff06; border: 1px solid #ffffff14; border-radius: 0.8rem; padding: 1rem 0.6rem;
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-ctrl__keys { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
  .vm-guide .vm-ctrl__label { font-size: 0.86rem; color: #b9b6c7; font-weight: 600; }

  /* Callout */
  .vm-guide .vm-callout {
    border-radius: 0.9rem; padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem; margin: 1.4rem 0;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 40%, transparent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 8%, transparent);
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-callout__tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.82rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--c); font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-callout p { margin: 0 0 0.6rem; color: #d3d0de; line-height: 1.55; }
  .vm-guide .vm-mini { margin: 0; padding-left: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .vm-guide .vm-mini li { color: #c5c2d2; line-height: 1.5; padding-left: 1.1rem; position: relative; font-size: 0.96rem; }
  .vm-guide .vm-mini li::before { content: "▸"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--c); }
  .vm-guide .vm-mini strong { color: #f3f1f8; }

  /* Tips */
  .vm-guide .vm-tips { display: grid; gap: 0.6rem; }
  .vm-guide .vm-tip {
    display: flex; gap: 0.8rem; align-items: flex-start;
    background: #ffffff06; border: 1px solid #ffffff12; border-radius: 0.7rem; padding: 0.8rem 0.95rem;
    color: #c5c2d2; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 0.98rem;
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-tip__i { font-size: 1.15rem; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .vm-guide .vm-tip strong { color: #f3f1f8; }

  /* Problem -> fix */
  .vm-guide .vm-fixes { display: grid; gap: 0.6rem; }
  .vm-guide .vm-fix {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(8.5rem, 0.4fr) 1fr; gap: 0.9rem; align-items: center;
    background: #ffffff06; border: 1px solid #ffffff12; border-radius: 0.7rem; padding: 0.8rem 0.95rem;
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-fix__p {
    font-weight: 700; color: #ffcaca; font-size: 0.95rem;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-fix__p::before { content: "✕"; color: #ff6b6b; font-weight: 900; }
  .vm-guide .vm-fix__f { color: #c5c2d2; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 0.95rem; }

  .vm-guide .vm-outro {
    margin: 1.8rem 0 0; padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 0.9rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--g) 8%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--g) 30%, transparent);
    color: #d3d0de; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .vm-guide .vm-outro strong { color: var(--g); }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .vm-guide .vm-fix { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.35rem; }
    .vm-guide .vm-step { padding: 1rem; }
  }
</style>
